Scenario 1 – Home Gateway IoT Network (Ping Debugging)

 Objective
Identify the IoT device with incorrect IP configuration, fix the issue, and verify network connectivity 

  Steps Performed
- Tested all IoT devices using Ping (Simulation Mode).
- Identified the device with IP configuration issue.
- Corrected the IP configuration.
- Verified successful ping from the Smartphone.
- Confirmed the device reconnected to the Home Gateway.

  Result
All IoT devices responded successfully to ping after fixing the IP configuration.
